'' Error recovery: a deliberately broken file must yield a FEW useful diagnostics with
'' the first one at the real mistake, never a cascade and never a crash
'' (docs/plan/04 section 8). Each of these previously produced either a cascade or --
'' worse -- silence, because an error node's payload was indexed as if it were real.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --parse-only tests/parser/broken/bad-decl.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 3
'' EXPECT-OUT: TKO0406
